WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.868
-Thank you very much.
Enjoy yourself. Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.567
Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.901
to "The Tonight Show."
You're here.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:10.400
Thank you for watching.
Thank you.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.767
Well, guys,
everyone's talking about

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.834
the legal case of the century.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.200
And we finally got our answer.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.367
Gwyneth Paltrow
was found not responsible

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:21.133
for her ski accident.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:23.968
[ Applause ]

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.667
Of course, the other big news
is that former President Trump

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.033
was indicted
for the hush-money payment

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:32.167
he made to porn star
Stormy Daniels.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:33.300
Trump...

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:39.567
Trump is like, "I didn't do it.
I didn't do it.

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:43.167
And if I did do it,
I barely did it.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:45.067
My first witness is Stormy.
Did I do it?"

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.334
"Well, we..."

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.033
"Technically, Your Honor,
we didn't actually do it."

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:49.334
But I don't know.

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:51.033
Everyone is talking
about Trump's indictment.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:53.200
The news is so huge
that even CNN was like,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.667
"We're back, baby!"

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.601
Of course, some people
are worried that Trump's arrest

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:01.667
will create division
in the country.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.501
Right.
'Cause we were just having

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:07.133
one big old pizza party
before this.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.267
I read that Trump and his team
were caught off guard

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:10.534
by the news as they thought

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:13.467
any potential indictment
was weeks away.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.634
Not great when everyone's like,
"We knew you'd go to jail.

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:18.000
We just didn't think
it'd be so soon, you know?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.033
Chance to say goodbye to you."

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.534
Of course, after the news broke,

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.667
Trump got on social media
and started ranting.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:26.200
And in one post,
instead of writing "indicted,"

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.334
he accidentally wrote
"indicated."

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:33.968
♪♪

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:37.334
Then when asked how he'll plead,
Trump wrote "Nut Gravy."

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:40.968
♪♪

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:42.400
-That's what
he got in trouble for!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.534
-"Not guilty."

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:44.901
♪♪

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.968
-Stormy!
-Meanwhile...

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:50.868
Meanwhile, people are wondering

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.434
how Trump's gonna
get out of this.

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:55.033
And Trump says that you can read
all about it in his new book,

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.801
"The Art of the Plea Deal."

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:58.801
And -- And get this.

00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:00.534
I read that
Manhattan prosecutors

00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:03.567
are also investigating
a second hush-money payment

00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:06.834
that Trump might have made
for another affair.

00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:09.033
Right now Trump's panicking.
He's like, "O-M-G.

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:11.501
What if Stormy finds out
I cheated on her?"

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:13.701
♪♪

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:15.033
But if Trump is convicted,

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:17.367
he could be imprisoned
for four years --

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:18.934
or two years with good behavior.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:20.801
So...four years.

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:22.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:25.767
But here's some
good news for Trump.

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:29.100
Even if he is convicted,
he can still run for president.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.467
And he can still hold rallies

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:33.567
because a lot of his supporters
are also in prison.

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:36.534
"January 6th? January 6th?
January 6th?

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:39.267
Come over to my table."

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:40.801
Yeah, there's a good chance
Trump could be

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:43.434
the first candidate with a
cellmate for a running mate.

00:02:43.434 --> 00:02:45.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.200
Some business news.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:52.167
Tesla just launched its own beer
called GigaBier.

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:54.133
Yeah. It's a Tesla beer.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:57.000
It's the only beer that explodes
even if you don't shake it.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:01.467
Not gonna stop me from drinking.
-Yeah.

00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:02.868
-Some more business news.

00:03:02.868 --> 00:03:07.033
I saw that McDonald's stock
just closed at an all-time high.

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:09.000
Yeah, also closing
at an all-time high --

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.467
the 16-year-old
McDonald's manager, Kyle.

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:15.367
[Sleepily] "Alright.
We're closed, man.

00:03:15.367 --> 00:03:17.868
[ Giggles ]
We can't serve breakfast any --

00:03:17.868 --> 00:03:20.434
Oh, sorry. We can't
serve breakfast any..."

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:22.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:25.000
Yep, McDonald's stock
is through the roof,

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.300
which must mean Trump
has started packing for prison.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.234
That's...

00:03:29.234 --> 00:03:32.567
Yeah, I heard that the FDA
will now require medical devices

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:34.701
to be secured
against cyberattacks.

00:03:34.701 --> 00:03:36.133
Did you see that?

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:37.734
It's a little frightening when
you're getting an ultrasound

00:03:37.734 --> 00:03:38.934
and you hear...

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:40.567
[Russian accent]
"Congratulations. It is boy."

00:03:40.567 --> 00:03:42.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:48.534
And, finally, today is
the very last day of March,

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:50.834
so I thought it'd be nice
to give a little recap

00:03:50.834 --> 00:03:52.100
of the entire month.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.801
Here we go. Thank you.

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:02.734
