00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:33.968
♪ I'm scared of that ChatGPT ♪

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:37.067
♪ Twitter's business in the
tank, still better than... ♪

00:04:37.067 --> 00:04:38.968
-Silicon Valley Bank.

00:04:38.968 --> 00:04:40.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.834
-♪ Yeah, the Oscars
