00:04:41.834 --> 00:04:43.968
♪ "Everything, Everywhere,
All at Once" ♪

00:04:43.968 --> 00:04:45.767
♪ Next year,
it could be "John Wick" ♪

00:04:45.767 --> 00:04:47.400
♪ The only star not on... ♪

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.300
-♪ Oh, oh, oh, Ozempic ♪

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.868 --> 00:04:55.934
-♪ Pascal is in every show ♪

00:04:55.934 --> 00:04:57.467
