00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:01.334
♪ If you don't watch,
then, just... ♪

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:02.434
-[Bleep] off!

00:05:02.434 --> 00:05:03.601
-Whoa!

00:05:03.601 --> 00:05:05.501
-♪ Massive news
we got last night ♪

00:05:05.501 --> 00:05:07.601
♪ Jury choosing to indict ♪

00:05:07.601 --> 00:05:10.767
♪ Trump will act like he's
Shaggy, when he says... ♪

00:05:10.767 --> 00:05:12.267
-It wasn't me.
-Yeah.

00:05:12.267 --> 00:05:14.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.534 --> 00:05:16.934
[ Applause ]

00:05:16.934 --> 00:05:19.234
-It's just -- Thank you.

00:05:19.234 --> 00:05:21.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:24.534
Shagg-ee? Shagg-ee.

00:05:24.534 --> 00:05:26.901
-Shagg-ee. Shagg-ee.
-Wow.

00:05:26.901 --> 00:05:28.033
-Shagg-ee.

00:05:28.033 --> 00:05:30.868
-♪ It wasn't me ♪
-That's right.

00:05:30.868 --> 00:05:33.167
♪ It was the third month
of the year ♪

00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:35.200
♪ Shamrock Shakes
and cold green beer ♪

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.067
♪ Chilly weather,
I've had plenty ♪

00:05:37.067 --> 00:05:40.968
♪ So let's heat things up
